            <title>1.2.1.4</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:29:16 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Fixes

- Setting up password-free mode works again. Before, it failed after you entered your Mac password, with a message that a terminal is required.
- If password-free mode still can’t be set up from the app, the message now explains how to turn it on from Terminal instead.

Still made for **Patchy 1.2.1**.
]]></description>
